      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Menasha%2C_Wisconsin",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Menasha approved $150,000 in bonds in 1854 to bring the Manitowoc & Mississippi Railroad, aiming to make the city a rail and water hub.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
